{"author":"Joe Oakhart","author_email":"joeoakhart@navapbc.com","data":{"alias":"detonable-privy-burro","creation_channel":"cli","description":"Add a bounded re-review cycle cap per ticket (plan review) and per change (code review). Convergence data shows normal work converges in a small number of cycles, so a cap at the tail costs nothing in the common case; beyond the cap an explicit human override is required, preventing runaway review loops. Acceptance: cap enforced on both gates; override path audited; distribution of cycle counts unchanged for normal work.","id":"bb7e-53c9-b028-4235","parent_id":"887c-009e-bc96-48c8","priority":2,"tags":["cost"],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Cap re-review cycles on plan review and code review with explicit override"},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1789406139166285001,"uuid":"5c0dae05-6032-4dc3-bb56-95ff8b19ef54"}